---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, "/"); // "/profitprint/"
---
<Base title="About — PrintProfit" description="What PrintProfit is and who it's for.">
  <h1>About PrintProfit</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated 2026-08-18</p>

  <p>PrintProfit is a small independent project with one goal: help people who sell 3D prints understand whether they're actually making money. We build free tools and write honest guides — no hype, no guaranteed-income promises, and no fake reviews.</p>

  <h2>What we make</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A <a href={`${base}tool/`}>free pricing calculator</a> that includes the costs most sellers forget.</li>
    <li>Plain-English <a href={`${base}guides/`}>guides</a> on pricing, costing, and selling prints.</li>
    <li>A <a href="https://payhip.com/b/NZ1Xb">Pro spreadsheet</a> for people running a real print shop.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we stay free</h2>
  <p>The plan is affiliate links and, later, modest display ads. <strong>Neither is running yet</strong> &mdash; today the site earns nothing and costs nothing to use. See our <a href={`${base}disclosure/`}>affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:printprofit@hollowmast.com">printprofit@hollowmast.com</a></p>
</Base>
